@host = http://localhost:5080
@unknownProductId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Invalid quantity
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "{{unknownProductId}}", "quantity": 0 }

### Unknown, Draft, and Discontinued products return 400 when used here
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "{{unknownProductId}}", "quantity": 1 }
